* The pitch stage as netlisted (hardware/module/pitch-stage/netlist.yaml), one subcircuit
* every deck here instantiates - twice where a deck compares the stage with and without
* D-ESD-PITCH. Ports: vrefout (the DAC's VREFOUT), dac (DAC ch1, after R-BIAS-DAC, which
* the deck places at the source), jack (JACK_TIP), pos/neg (the analog rails), vrefb
* (VREF_BUFFERED, brought out to measure), minus (MINUS_NODE) and inm (U-PITCH.INB-):
* a closed loop ties minus to inm; pitch-loop.cir breaks it there.
*
* V_ref: TRIM-OFFSET across VREFOUT (CW) and AGND_MOD (CCW), its wiper at w_offset from
* the AGND end, injecting through R-VREF-INJ against R-VREF-SER into U-PITCH half A,
* at gain 1 + R-VREF-FB/R-VREF-GND. The stage: U-PITCH half B, R1 of RN-PITCH from
* VREF_BUFFERED through R-GAIN-CTR, R2 of RN-PITCH plus TRIM-GAIN's CCW-W section
* (t_gain of its track; its CW end is strapped to the wiper) from the JACK, C-FB-PITCH
* from the op-amp output, R-OUT-PROT inside the DC loop, C-FILT-PITCH at the jack.
* D-JACK-CLAMP (BAV99: A to the -12 V rail, K to the +12 V rail, C on AMP_OUT, the
* op-amp side of R-OUT-PROT) as two diodes, DJC: reverse-biased while the op-amp's output
* is inside the rails. The patch and short sims measure its current rather than assume it.
* DJC is a SPICE diode through the banked datasheet's MAXIMUM VF - 715 mV at 1 mA, 855 mV
* at 10 mA, 1.25 V at 150 mA, Cd 1.5 pF max [ds NEXPERIA-BAV99-SOT23.pdf p.3, Tamb 25 C]:
* [calc: the three equations V = N Vt ln(I/IS) + I RS at Vt 25.9 mV give IS 1.77 nA,
* N 2.08, RS 1.78 ohm]. A model, not a part value, so it is written here once, where every
* deck that places PSTAGE (this directory's, module/power-entry's, interfaces/system's)
* reads it.
.subckt PSTAGE vrefout dac jack pos neg vrefb minus inm
RTOCW vrefout wip {{r_toff_cw}}
RTOCCW wip 0 {{r_toff_ccw}}
RINJ wip vsum {{R-VREF-INJ}}
RSER vrefout vsum {{R-VREF-SER}}
XRB vsum vfb pos neg vrefb OPAx197
RVFB vrefb vfb {{R-VREF-FB}}
RVGND vfb 0 {{R-VREF-GND}}
RCTR vrefb r1b {{R-GAIN-CTR}}
R1 r1b minus {{RN-PITCH}}
R2 minus gtm {{RN-PITCH}}
RTG gtm jack {{r_trim_gain}}
RIN dac plus {{R-OPAMP-IN}}
CAA plus 0 {{C-AA-PITCH}}
XAMP plus inm pos neg ampout OPAx197
CFB ampout minus {{C-FB-PITCH}}
ROUT ampout jack {{R-OUT-PROT}}
CFILT jack 0 {{C-FILT-PITCH}}
DJCN neg ampout DJC
DJCP ampout pos DJC
.ends
.model DJC D(IS=1.77e-9 N=2.08 RS=1.78 CJO=1.5e-12)
